#Macro: Title, Step 4, ide://run?File=%COMSPEC%&Args=/c&Args=copy&Args=%PROJECT%\..\release\Pakai+Server+(6.99+rev2).b4xtemplate&Args=%ADDITIONAL%
#Macro: Title, Step 5, ide://run?File=%WINDIR%\SysWOW64\explorer.exe&Args=%PROJECT%\..\release
